WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:44.439 --> 00:00:49.069
DEAR X

2
00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.905
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

3
00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:53.615
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

4
00:00:55.492 --> 00:00:56.535
Mom.

5
00:00:56.994 --> 00:00:57.995
I'm here to see you.

6
00:00:58.579 --> 00:00:59.872
THE LATE LIM SUN YE

7
00:00:59.955 --> 00:01:00.956
How is it up there?

8
00:01:01.707 --> 00:01:02.708
Is it any better?

9
00:01:06.128 --> 00:01:07.379
I'm doing just fine.

10
00:01:09.631 --> 00:01:12.593
This girl in my class
has been acting up.

11
00:01:13.677 --> 00:01:14.803
She got on my nerves.

12
00:01:15.554 --> 00:01:16.555
But it's fine.

13
00:01:19.099 --> 00:01:21.143
I have something for you.

14
00:01:21.226 --> 00:01:22.436
Want to know what it is?

15
00:01:25.689 --> 00:01:27.482
Was it at the start of the semester?

16
00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.777
I had to turn in
an assignment for art class.

17
00:01:32.112 --> 00:01:34.031
I got the deadline wrong

18
00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:36.158
and had to turn it in incomplete.

19
00:01:36.241 --> 00:01:39.369
I went to my art teacher and said...

20
00:01:40.162 --> 00:01:41.163
"Sir.

21
00:01:42.581 --> 00:01:46.543
I was abused as a child.

22
00:01:46.627 --> 00:01:49.004
I think my wrist is still weak.

23
00:01:50.214 --> 00:01:53.175
I can't seem to finish my artwork.

24
00:01:54.551 --> 00:01:56.511
I can't draw properly.

25
00:01:59.765 --> 00:02:00.766
What should I do?"

26
00:02:03.268 --> 00:02:04.478
I mistakenly thought

27
00:02:04.561 --> 00:02:08.315
he'd give me a good grade
if I said that.

28
00:02:09.274 --> 00:02:12.069
I'm not sure
if he really took pity on me

29
00:02:12.861 --> 00:02:14.780
or if he saw through my lies.

30
00:02:14.863 --> 00:02:16.823
He kept telling me
to see a psycholo--

31
00:02:16.907 --> 00:02:17.908
Did you eat?

32
00:02:19.076 --> 00:02:20.077
Hey.

33
00:02:20.953 --> 00:02:23.288
About what I said last time.

34
00:02:23.372 --> 00:02:24.831
There's no pressure at all.

35
00:02:24.915 --> 00:02:26.917
Just vent and release what's inside.

36
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.293
TRUE LOVE COUNSELING CENTER

37
00:02:28.377 --> 00:02:29.378
Give them a call.

38
00:02:32.965 --> 00:02:34.174
He's an interesting guy.

39
00:02:40.931 --> 00:02:42.057
I'll leave this here.

40
00:02:42.849 --> 00:02:43.850
It's a gift.

41
00:02:44.893 --> 00:02:47.020
Get some counseling over in hell

42
00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:49.940
and be born again.

43
00:02:50.941 --> 00:02:52.067
Who knows?

44
00:02:52.609 --> 00:02:53.610
In your next life

45
00:02:54.945 --> 00:02:56.488
your daughter might save you.

46
00:02:57.572 --> 00:02:59.866
I won't ever live like you.

47
00:03:03.036 --> 00:03:04.621
I won't die like you, either.

48
00:03:06.498 --> 00:03:08.542
Watch from where you are

49
00:03:09.918 --> 00:03:11.503
just how far I climb.

50
00:03:14.673 --> 00:03:17.968
Then you'll feel less wronged
about how you died

51
00:03:19.928 --> 00:03:22.097
and your death will carry more value.

52
00:03:32.316 --> 00:03:35.819
JUNE 2007

53
00:03:41.491 --> 00:03:43.118
GENERAL STORE

54
00:03:43.201 --> 00:03:44.202
Ah Jin.

55
00:03:46.705 --> 00:03:48.040
Get me two bottles.

56
00:03:48.749 --> 00:03:49.791
Go on.

57
00:04:08.977 --> 00:04:12.147
You're the little thief
who's been stealing from me, right?

58
00:04:12.981 --> 00:04:14.191
Where's your mom?

59
00:04:14.483 --> 00:04:16.026
Goddamn it.

60
00:04:24.117 --> 00:04:25.118
Honey.

61
00:05:11.748 --> 00:05:13.750
Are you taking me to an orphanage?

62
00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.879
We'll live here from now on.

63
00:05:17.963 --> 00:05:20.507
If you listen to your stepmom
and don't get in trouble

64
00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.843
I'll let you stay here
until you grow up.

65
00:05:22.926 --> 00:05:24.136
Will you really?

66
00:05:48.702 --> 00:05:49.703
Hello.

67
00:06:00.213 --> 00:06:01.548
Jun Seo.

68
00:06:04.176 --> 00:06:05.302
Say hello.

69
00:06:05.385 --> 00:06:07.429
He's your stepdad who just moved in.

70
00:06:07.888 --> 00:06:08.889
Hi.

71
00:06:26.907 --> 00:06:27.908
Hi.

72
00:06:28.325 --> 00:06:29.576
I'm Baek Ah Jin.

73
00:06:30.285 --> 00:06:32.579
Hi, I'm Yoon Jun Seo.

74
00:06:32.662 --> 00:06:34.873
All the assets that Jun Seo will get.

75
00:06:34.956 --> 00:06:37.417
I told the darned old man
I'd manage it all

76
00:06:37.501 --> 00:06:40.420
but the old fool won't listen.

77
00:06:41.463 --> 00:06:42.964
There are more mouths to feed.

78
00:06:44.382 --> 00:06:46.468
I won't make much
from selling this place.

79
00:06:47.219 --> 00:06:48.553
Do you have any ideas?

80
00:07:00.899 --> 00:07:02.442
Just you wait.

81
00:07:03.276 --> 00:07:05.695
We can make a fortune with the girl.

82
00:07:06.655 --> 00:07:07.864
She's worth quite a bit.

83
00:07:08.865 --> 00:07:10.909
Sell a few videos of her

84
00:07:11.868 --> 00:07:14.329
and we can move to a penthouse
overlooking the Hangang River.

85
00:07:14.955 --> 00:07:17.082
That video you speak of.

86
00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:20.877
We'll take a few
then ship her off to an orphanage.

87
00:07:21.586 --> 00:07:22.587
You bet.

88
00:07:24.798 --> 00:07:27.592
You'll be better off
if you don't upset her.

89
00:07:29.886 --> 00:07:32.472
She has her dead mom's dirty temper.

90
00:07:34.015 --> 00:07:35.725
She'll just gnaw you to bits.

91
00:07:36.851 --> 00:07:39.729
I'm not some meat on the bone.
Why would she gnaw me?

92
00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:57.163
EPISODE 2:
THE MOMENT A HUMAN BECOMES A DEVIL

93
00:08:05.797 --> 00:08:06.798
Keep the rest.

94
00:08:09.801 --> 00:08:11.636
Oh, I haven't been here in a while.

95
00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.472
SINGWANG HIGH SCHOOL

96
00:08:16.808 --> 00:08:18.727
I said no.

97
00:08:19.102 --> 00:08:21.187
If people find out
you slept with my English teacher

98
00:08:21.271 --> 00:08:23.648
I'll be too embarrassed
to stay in school!

99
00:08:25.358 --> 00:08:26.359
Whatever.

100
00:08:26.735 --> 00:08:28.486
I'm dropping out, and that's that.

101
00:08:29.988 --> 00:08:30.989
Hello?

102
00:08:31.489 --> 00:08:33.366
I'm looking for my daughter's school.

103
00:08:34.284 --> 00:08:35.744
It must be somewhere here

104
00:08:35.827 --> 00:08:37.579
but I can't tell
because I don't know where she lives.

105
00:08:38.371 --> 00:08:40.457
I was thinking
of squeezing her for money.

106
00:08:42.917 --> 00:08:44.461
You remember my Ah Jin, right?

107
00:08:45.003 --> 00:08:47.255
- Baek Ah Jin?
- She has one pretty face.

108
00:08:47.881 --> 00:08:49.591
She takes after me, Baek Seon Gyu.

109
00:08:49.674 --> 00:08:50.967
It's in her blood.

110
00:08:51.885 --> 00:08:52.886
Excuse me.

111
00:08:55.805 --> 00:08:59.184
Did you just say
your daughter's Baek Ah Jin?

112
00:08:59.267 --> 00:09:00.727
I'll call you later.

113
00:09:02.145 --> 00:09:03.438
Do you know Ah Jin?

114
00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:04.856
I'm her dad.

115
00:09:06.024 --> 00:09:07.817
Is she better off being an orphan?

116
00:09:09.861 --> 00:09:10.945
Why is she an orphan?

117
00:09:11.279 --> 00:09:12.280
It's Sim Sung Hee's notebook.

118
00:09:12.364 --> 00:09:13.657
SIM SUNG HEE

119
00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:17.994
She noted everyone's grades,
parents' jobs, and living standards.

120
00:09:18.703 --> 00:09:21.081
Everyone's graded
between A-plus and D.

121
00:09:22.415 --> 00:09:24.626
Anyone below B,
she scratched out in red.

122
00:09:29.923 --> 00:09:32.676
It's insane.
The kids would kill her if they knew.

123
00:09:32.759 --> 00:09:33.885
BAEK AH JIN, C-MINUS
YOON JUN SEO, A-PLUS

124
00:09:35.929 --> 00:09:37.806
Hey, what's an "Un..."

125
00:09:37.889 --> 00:09:39.099
KIM JAE OH, D
AN UNTOUCHABLE

126
00:09:39.182 --> 00:09:40.183
"Untouchable?"

127
00:09:40.767 --> 00:09:41.810
What does that mean?

128
00:09:42.811 --> 00:09:43.812
It sounds nasty.

129
00:09:51.194 --> 00:09:52.195
Hello?

130
00:09:52.278 --> 00:09:54.155
Ah Jin, your dad's here.

131
00:09:54.823 --> 00:09:56.700
- Who's here?
- Your dad.

132
00:09:56.783 --> 00:09:58.368
- He's here looking for you.
- Ah Jin!

133
00:09:58.451 --> 00:09:59.786
At the first floor
central staircase--

134
00:10:01.079 --> 00:10:02.163
Where are you off to?

135
00:10:03.039 --> 00:10:04.040
Baek Ah Jin!

136
00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.175
Where are you, Jae Oh? I'm scared.

137
00:10:14.592 --> 00:10:16.678
Dad keeps calling me Satan.

138
00:10:16.761 --> 00:10:17.762
Come home soon.

139
00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.933
Ah Jin!

140
00:10:23.184 --> 00:10:24.352
Baek Ah Jin!

141
00:10:24.853 --> 00:10:26.271
Dad's here!

142
00:10:27.981 --> 00:10:29.107
Baek Ah Jin!

143
00:10:29.607 --> 00:10:31.151
Guys, did you see Baek Ah Jin?

144
00:10:32.819 --> 00:10:36.531
Her father is looking for her.

145
00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.783
Well? You haven't seen her?

146
00:10:38.867 --> 00:10:40.535
Didn't she say she was an orphan?

147
00:10:41.035 --> 00:10:42.620
He's so weird. What's up with him?

148
00:10:42.704 --> 00:10:43.705
Dad.

149
00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.333
Who is this weirdo?

150
00:10:47.417 --> 00:10:49.043
Dad, come with me.

151
00:10:53.298 --> 00:10:54.424
Hey, Jun Seo.

152
00:10:54.966 --> 00:10:58.511
You go to this school, too?
You're all grown up.

153
00:10:58.595 --> 00:11:00.472
Where's Ah Jin?

154
00:11:00.972 --> 00:11:02.056
Let's head out, Dad.

155
00:11:02.474 --> 00:11:04.893
- Where's Ah Jin, you punk?
- I'll give you cash.

156
00:11:08.313 --> 00:11:09.314
I'll give you money.

157
00:11:13.943 --> 00:11:15.361
Mister!

158
00:11:16.112 --> 00:11:18.031
You're not Jun Seo's dad.

159
00:11:18.907 --> 00:11:22.702
Anyone who lived with me
under the same roof is my son.

160
00:11:25.705 --> 00:11:27.165
- How have you been?
- Mister!

161
00:11:27.248 --> 00:11:28.374
Mister!

162
00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:30.835
She's psycho.

163
00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.427
- What was that about?
- Darn it.

164
00:11:40.428 --> 00:11:41.429
What's this?

165
00:11:43.056 --> 00:11:44.974
- What is this?
- It looks funny.

166
00:11:45.058 --> 00:11:46.434
It has your name.

167
00:11:46.976 --> 00:11:48.561
What kind of bitch would...

168
00:12:09.582 --> 00:12:13.002
SEO MI RI
CEO OF LONGSTAR ENTERTAINMENT

169
00:12:34.858 --> 00:12:36.276
You didn't have to.

170
00:12:38.361 --> 00:12:40.196
The condition is
that you never appear

171
00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.198
near our school
or in front of Ah Jin.

172
00:12:42.699 --> 00:12:46.327
Don't call even if you're dying
of a terminal illness.

173
00:12:46.661 --> 00:12:47.871
She's my daughter.

174
00:12:48.162 --> 00:12:50.665
A dad wants to see his daughter.
What's wrong with that?

175
00:12:50.748 --> 00:12:54.502
When a dad's in a bind,
he can ask his daughter for help.

176
00:12:54.752 --> 00:12:56.963
You arrogant bastard.

177
00:12:57.297 --> 00:13:01.050
We can't sever our ties
just because you say so.

178
00:13:09.767 --> 00:13:12.186
I thought you'd say that,
so I only got you half.

179
00:13:13.313 --> 00:13:15.607
If you stay away from Ah Jin
until she graduates

180
00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.025
I'll give you the other half.

181
00:13:17.108 --> 00:13:18.776
She takes after me.

182
00:13:19.235 --> 00:13:20.486
She has a pretty face.

183
00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.323
I can get at least two large
if I sell her off to a bar.

184
00:13:24.824 --> 00:13:27.076
I hope you keep your word.

185
00:13:29.996 --> 00:13:32.916
Why would you go
to such lengths for her?

186
00:13:32.999 --> 00:13:34.709
You're complete strangers.

187
00:13:35.501 --> 00:13:38.796
You might not be related,
but you were step-siblings once.

188
00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.841
It's so nice to see you
look out for each other.

189
00:13:41.925 --> 00:13:43.968
You're pretty loyal, unlike your mom.

190
00:13:45.011 --> 00:13:46.429
Is that all you have to say?

191
00:13:47.263 --> 00:13:49.474
Don't you feel bad for Ah Jin at all?

192
00:13:50.058 --> 00:13:51.351
What are you on about?

193
00:14:01.361 --> 00:14:02.570
See you around, girlie.

194
00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.723
Are you Baek Ah Jin?

195
00:14:33.434 --> 00:14:34.435
Who are you?

196
00:14:40.775 --> 00:14:42.860
I'm Seo Mi Ri
from Longstar Entertainment.

197
00:14:43.736 --> 00:14:45.405
Would you like to be a celebrity?

198
00:14:48.533 --> 00:14:49.951
SEO MI RI

199
00:14:50.034 --> 00:14:51.327
You've heard of us, right?

200
00:14:52.745 --> 00:14:54.747
I'd love to make you an actress.

201
00:14:56.082 --> 00:14:57.083
No, thanks.

202
00:14:58.167 --> 00:14:59.168
Sorry.

203
00:15:02.296 --> 00:15:03.297
Wait.

204
00:15:06.009 --> 00:15:07.927
Are you in talks with another agency?

205
00:15:11.556 --> 00:15:13.808
I'd like to know
why you said no outright.

206
00:15:13.891 --> 00:15:15.393
I won't do anything like that.

207
00:15:27.822 --> 00:15:29.532
Where are you, Jae Oh?

208
00:15:29.615 --> 00:15:31.451
Hurry up!

209
00:15:40.835 --> 00:15:41.836
Dad...

210
00:15:42.462 --> 00:15:43.671
Dad...

211
00:15:43.755 --> 00:15:45.089
Dad!

212
00:15:45.798 --> 00:15:46.799
Satan.

213
00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.720
You're scheming
so you can possess my son.

214
00:15:51.054 --> 00:15:52.805
You evil devil.

215
00:15:53.556 --> 00:15:54.724
- Get out of--
- Stop!

216
00:15:57.852 --> 00:16:00.438
Are you crazy?
How can do this to a kid?

217
00:16:01.022 --> 00:16:03.483
Dad, take it out on me instead.

218
00:16:03.566 --> 00:16:04.942
Get the fuck off me.

219
00:16:08.946 --> 00:16:10.615
Please stop!

220
00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.078
You fool.

221
00:16:15.161 --> 00:16:17.080
Dad, please listen to me!

222
00:16:17.163 --> 00:16:18.790
- Dad!
-Leave me alone!

223
00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.091
Jae Oh.

224
00:16:34.514 --> 00:16:35.515
Dad...

225
00:17:02.166 --> 00:17:03.209
Jae Oh.

226
00:17:25.398 --> 00:17:26.399
Ah Jin.

227
00:17:29.485 --> 00:17:30.486
Are you all right?

228
00:17:32.989 --> 00:17:35.241
There's no need
to let the past get to you.

229
00:17:36.284 --> 00:17:37.535
He'll stay away for a while.

230
00:17:37.618 --> 00:17:40.246
He will. For a while.

231
00:17:41.372 --> 00:17:42.582
Don't worry too much.

232
00:17:45.459 --> 00:17:46.460
I'll do it all.

233
00:17:47.879 --> 00:17:50.214
I won't ever allow
another situation...

234
00:17:52.466 --> 00:17:53.968
in which I can't do anything.

235
00:17:54.552 --> 00:17:56.012
Don't worry about your dad.

236
00:17:56.929 --> 00:17:59.557
He'll do anything for money,
so he was easy to handle.

237
00:18:06.898 --> 00:18:08.191
About Sim Sung Hee.

238
00:18:09.233 --> 00:18:11.319
How did she manage
to bring your dad to our school?

239
00:18:12.361 --> 00:18:13.821
Now he knows where to find you.

240
00:18:13.905 --> 00:18:15.114
I took care of her.

241
00:18:29.337 --> 00:18:30.463
What are you doing?

242
00:18:30.546 --> 00:18:32.340
I'll give you money.

243
00:18:36.135 --> 00:18:37.970
Do you think
we're after your fucking money?

244
00:18:38.471 --> 00:18:39.513
What is this?

245
00:18:39.597 --> 00:18:41.140
You're still all up
in other people's business.

246
00:18:41.224 --> 00:18:43.434
We beat you up in middle school,
but that wasn't enough?

247
00:18:43.851 --> 00:18:46.270
Why am I an untouchable?

248
00:18:46.354 --> 00:18:48.940
Why ask? It means you're dirt poor.

249
00:18:49.023 --> 00:18:50.024
You bitch.

250
00:18:50.107 --> 00:18:52.235
This won't do.
I'll beat you to death.

251
00:18:52.318 --> 00:18:54.820
You might actually get sentenced
for assault.

252
00:18:54.904 --> 00:18:57.073
- What are you saying?
- You're over 14!

253
00:18:57.156 --> 00:18:59.116
Shut your mouth, bitch.

254
00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.744
I'll just kill you then kill myself.

255
00:19:01.827 --> 00:19:02.912
How about that?

256
00:19:02.995 --> 00:19:06.707
My family is dirt poor,
and I have no damn future anyway.

257
00:19:06.791 --> 00:19:09.210
- Let's all go to prison together.
- To prison!

258
00:19:17.009 --> 00:19:18.010
Yes, Auntie.

259
00:19:18.469 --> 00:19:19.470
Kim Jae Oh.

260
00:19:20.054 --> 00:19:23.015
You can't send your brother over
at this time of night.

261
00:19:23.683 --> 00:19:25.559
The taxi fare came out to 60,000 won.

262
00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.604
Do you know how surprised we were?

263
00:19:30.189 --> 00:19:31.983
And why is he such a mess?

264
00:19:32.066 --> 00:19:34.277
- I was so--
- Take him to a hospital.

265
00:19:36.612 --> 00:19:38.114
He needs a guardian.

266
00:19:40.032 --> 00:19:41.284
I can't be there for him.

267
00:19:41.742 --> 00:19:42.743
What's wrong?

268
00:19:43.119 --> 00:19:44.495
What's going on?

269
00:19:48.082 --> 00:19:49.083
Auntie.

270
00:19:51.752 --> 00:19:52.753
Jae Hun...

271
00:19:55.256 --> 00:19:57.967
Look after him for me.

272
00:20:00.011 --> 00:20:01.429
He was badly beaten

273
00:20:03.222 --> 00:20:05.141
and he saw something
he shouldn't have.

274
00:20:06.684 --> 00:20:07.727
He'll be in shock.

275
00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.563
- Gosh, did your dad do something?
- I'm sorry, Auntie.

276
00:20:11.939 --> 00:20:12.940
Don't forgive me.

277
00:20:16.319 --> 00:20:18.195
I promise to pay...

278
00:20:20.448 --> 00:20:21.699
for what I did.

279
00:20:22.867 --> 00:20:24.744
Jae Oh, what on earth--

280
00:20:44.972 --> 00:20:45.973
What's up?

281
00:20:46.932 --> 00:20:47.933
You picked up.

282
00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.770
I tried calling one last time.

283
00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.023
What do you mean, "last time"?

284
00:20:54.315 --> 00:20:55.649
I killed that punk.

285
00:20:56.817 --> 00:20:57.902
What?

286
00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.781
I stabbed him.

287
00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:03.991
He's dead.

288
00:21:06.869 --> 00:21:07.870
What you just said.

289
00:21:08.496 --> 00:21:09.497
Is it true?

290
00:21:09.789 --> 00:21:10.873
Was there a witness?

291
00:21:13.125 --> 00:21:14.585
I'm in front of the police station.

292
00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.921
I'm going to turn myself in.

293
00:21:18.297 --> 00:21:19.590
I don't regret it, though.

294
00:21:20.549 --> 00:21:21.884
Pretend to regret it.

295
00:21:23.052 --> 00:21:24.720
So people will pity you.

296
00:21:29.183 --> 00:21:30.184
Why?

297
00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.145
Does the future law student think

298
00:21:34.063 --> 00:21:35.815
I'll rot in prison for a long time?

299
00:21:36.941 --> 00:21:37.942
Kim Jae Oh.

300
00:21:44.448 --> 00:21:45.741
Even if you go to prison

301
00:21:46.492 --> 00:21:50.079
you'll still be free since you've cut
the chain that was tying you down.

302
00:21:50.996 --> 00:21:52.623
What's important
is what happens next.

303
00:21:53.791 --> 00:21:55.751
You were a victim
before you were an assailant.

304
00:21:56.627 --> 00:21:57.878
Appeal with that.

305
00:21:58.421 --> 00:22:01.424
Cry, wail, and tremble,
and pretend to be remorseful.

306
00:22:03.175 --> 00:22:04.176
Do you get that?

307
00:22:07.388 --> 00:22:08.556
Baek Ah Jin.

308
00:22:11.892 --> 00:22:13.144
You're so weird.

309
00:22:16.772 --> 00:22:18.149
Thanks, though.

310
00:22:20.401 --> 00:22:22.319
I don't know
if that was meant to be comforting

311
00:22:23.904 --> 00:22:25.030
but thanks.

312
00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:28.367
For talking in my favor
instead of criticizing me

313
00:22:29.326 --> 00:22:30.327
for killing someone.

314
00:22:32.455 --> 00:22:33.747
You're wrong, though.

315
00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:41.881
I am trash.

316
00:22:45.634 --> 00:22:47.219
I should hang up now.

317
00:22:48.846 --> 00:22:49.847
Take care.

318
00:22:52.391 --> 00:22:53.392
You were

319
00:22:54.768 --> 00:22:56.645
the only person
who said I was useful.

320
00:22:59.315 --> 00:23:00.316
Thanks for that.

321
00:23:02.485 --> 00:23:03.611
Look after yourself...

322
00:23:04.862 --> 00:23:05.863
Baek Ah Jin.

323
00:23:29.011 --> 00:23:32.515
Sim Sung Hee did all she could
to drag down Ah Jin.

324
00:23:33.891 --> 00:23:36.227
She transferred schools
in a hurry as if to flee.

325
00:23:39.063 --> 00:23:42.149
As no one ever got on
Ah Jin's nerves again...

326
00:23:44.735 --> 00:23:45.736
we got to enjoy

327
00:23:47.154 --> 00:23:50.115
the ordinary kind of life
every other teenager did.

328
00:23:59.875 --> 00:24:02.920
We lived in peace
as if God smiled upon us

329
00:24:04.129 --> 00:24:05.923
and a few more seasons passed.

330
00:24:12.179 --> 00:24:13.180
Ah Jin...

331
00:24:13.264 --> 00:24:14.348
2018 ADMISSION RESULTS

332
00:24:14.932 --> 00:24:16.934
...got into Hankook University's
Department of Law.

333
00:24:17.017 --> 00:24:18.894
BAEK AH JIN, SINGWANG HIGH,
DEPARTMENT OF LAW

334
00:24:18.978 --> 00:24:20.479
CONGRATULATIONS

335
00:24:20.938 --> 00:24:22.606
You're in! Yes!

336
00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:24.650
How did you get
into Hankook University?

337
00:24:24.733 --> 00:24:26.569
DECEMBER 2017, ADMITTED
TO HANKOOK UNIVERSITY'S DEPT OF LAW

338
00:24:28.612 --> 00:24:29.613
Also...

339
00:24:29.697 --> 00:24:30.698
NOJEONG-DONG PATRICIDE

340
00:24:30.781 --> 00:24:34.243
...the Nojeong-dong patricide
that everyone talked about

341
00:24:34.994 --> 00:24:36.120
was soon forgotten.

342
00:24:36.203 --> 00:24:37.204
DEFENDANT

343
00:24:37.288 --> 00:24:39.790
We'll consider the jury's decision...

344
00:24:39.873 --> 00:24:41.375
Will you really study law?

345
00:24:45.337 --> 00:24:46.380
Once we graduate

346
00:24:47.423 --> 00:24:49.216
I'll never see you again.

347
00:24:50.050 --> 00:24:51.635
Why? Do you want to see me?

348
00:24:56.390 --> 00:24:59.893
Then quit stealing stuff
and get your life back on track.

349
00:25:01.228 --> 00:25:03.439
If and when you become
more useful than you are now

350
00:25:03.522 --> 00:25:05.107
I might have a use for you.

351
00:25:05.941 --> 00:25:07.276
Then we could meet again.

352
00:25:09.194 --> 00:25:11.739
What Baek Ah Jin said to me that day.

353
00:25:12.573 --> 00:25:14.325
Why does it come to mind today?

354
00:25:14.408 --> 00:25:17.745
The defendant's parents
should've protected him, but...

355
00:25:17.828 --> 00:25:18.912
Jae Oh.

356
00:25:19.455 --> 00:25:20.914
You're not useless.

357
00:25:21.874 --> 00:25:23.000
At least, not to me.

358
00:25:24.501 --> 00:25:27.421
Will I even get another chance?

359
00:25:28.339 --> 00:25:32.885
We also accept the fact
that it was an accidental death

360
00:25:32.968 --> 00:25:34.303
caused during a struggle

361
00:25:34.928 --> 00:25:38.432
in which the defendant protected
his brother who was being abused.

362
00:25:38.515 --> 00:25:42.311
I sentence you
to three to five years in prison.

363
00:25:42.394 --> 00:25:48.901
NOJEONG-DONG PATRICIDE
SENTENCED TO 3 TO 5 YEARS

364
00:25:50.194 --> 00:25:51.695
I won this time.

365
00:25:51.779 --> 00:25:52.780
All in.

366
00:26:08.587 --> 00:26:09.630
Fuck this!

367
00:26:23.769 --> 00:26:25.145
Welcome.

368
00:26:28.065 --> 00:26:29.108
A pack of cigarettes.

369
00:26:29.858 --> 00:26:33.445
Students can print their tuition bill
at their university's website...

370
00:26:33.529 --> 00:26:34.905
4,500 won, please.

371
00:26:37.991 --> 00:26:41.995
CONGRATULATIONS ON YOUR ACCEPTANCE

372
00:26:51.672 --> 00:26:53.757
Baek Ah Jin, Yoon Jun Seo.

373
00:26:53.841 --> 00:26:54.925
YOON JUN SEO, ANAM UNIVERSITY

374
00:27:01.432 --> 00:27:02.891
You want a loan?

375
00:27:08.814 --> 00:27:09.982
She's a friend of mine.

376
00:27:11.066 --> 00:27:13.068
She doesn't have enough
for her tuition.

377
00:27:13.527 --> 00:27:15.320
I'm in no position to help her.

378
00:27:16.113 --> 00:27:19.283
So what? You know your grandpa's rich

379
00:27:19.366 --> 00:27:21.076
and you want to be benevolent?

380
00:27:21.785 --> 00:27:23.495
No, lend it to me.

381
00:27:23.954 --> 00:27:25.330
Since I have no collateral

382
00:27:25.914 --> 00:27:28.459
if you agree to give me a loan,
I'll pay you back every cent

383
00:27:28.542 --> 00:27:31.962
at a higher interest rate
than what you charge your clients.

384
00:27:32.337 --> 00:27:35.048
You’re using our blood ties
as collateral

385
00:27:35.132 --> 00:27:36.383
but offering a higher interest
in return?

386
00:27:38.135 --> 00:27:39.887
It'll be pretty steep, then.

387
00:27:39.970 --> 00:27:41.388
Do you have a way to pay me back?

388
00:27:41.889 --> 00:27:43.724
Yes, I'll find students to tutor

389
00:27:43.807 --> 00:27:45.601
and I'm looking for a part-time job.

390
00:27:47.436 --> 00:27:49.605
You'll have no time left to study.

391
00:27:50.397 --> 00:27:54.109
You know I travel to Japan
every two months for treatment.

392
00:27:54.193 --> 00:27:55.778
If you tag along

393
00:27:55.861 --> 00:27:59.239
for three days and two nights
as my secretary and guardian

394
00:27:59.323 --> 00:28:02.576
I can waive the interest. How's that?

395
00:28:04.369 --> 00:28:07.164
Okay, as a debtor,
I'll pay you back with interest

396
00:28:07.831 --> 00:28:09.833
and as a grandson,
I'll be your guardian.

397
00:28:10.417 --> 00:28:12.711
I offered a deal,
and you're making a donation.

398
00:28:13.462 --> 00:28:15.964
You're such a softie.

399
00:28:17.925 --> 00:28:20.093
We leave tomorrow. Get packing.

400
00:28:21.220 --> 00:28:23.555
Okay. Thank you, Grandfather.

401
00:28:35.984 --> 00:28:38.445
I smell money on you.
You look nicer, too.

402
00:28:39.154 --> 00:28:40.489
How did you find me?

403
00:28:44.243 --> 00:28:45.619
I'm Baek Seon Gyu.

404
00:28:48.872 --> 00:28:49.873
Is Jun Seo well?

405
00:28:51.792 --> 00:28:52.835
What do you want?

406
00:28:54.002 --> 00:28:55.754
Be nice.

407
00:29:00.092 --> 00:29:01.301
Where does Ah Jin live?

408
00:29:02.511 --> 00:29:03.971
Why ask me about your daughter?

409
00:29:04.763 --> 00:29:07.307
That's why I asked
about your son first.

410
00:29:08.475 --> 00:29:10.102
You know where she lives, don't you?

411
00:29:10.769 --> 00:29:11.770
I don't.

412
00:29:12.729 --> 00:29:14.815
I kept her for a few years
after you went to prison.

413
00:29:15.607 --> 00:29:17.109
She left of her own accord.

414
00:29:18.068 --> 00:29:20.153
You left the young girl
on the street?

415
00:29:21.029 --> 00:29:23.407
I have no obligation
to look after your kid.

416
00:29:25.576 --> 00:29:27.828
Jun Seo must know where she lives.

417
00:29:28.412 --> 00:29:30.581
They used to be step-siblings.

418
00:29:31.039 --> 00:29:32.708
Leave Jun Seo alone.

419
00:29:35.210 --> 00:29:39.047
He got into Anam University.

420
00:29:53.937 --> 00:29:57.566
MS BANK, BAEK AH JIN
1,577,900 WON

421
00:30:12.372 --> 00:30:13.457
Did I make you wait?

422
00:30:16.627 --> 00:30:18.378
- Two gukbap, please.
- Okay.

423
00:30:19.755 --> 00:30:21.048
Congratulations, Ah Jin.

424
00:30:21.131 --> 00:30:22.758
You got a scholarship.

425
00:30:23.592 --> 00:30:24.593
What are you on about?

426
00:30:24.676 --> 00:30:28.013
I applied for a scholarship for you,
and you got it just like that.

427
00:30:32.100 --> 00:30:33.101
Ta-da.

428
00:30:34.895 --> 00:30:36.813
My grandfather decided

429
00:30:36.897 --> 00:30:39.524
to start giving scholarships
to students this year.

430
00:30:39.858 --> 00:30:41.902
I raised my hand right away.

431
00:30:41.985 --> 00:30:44.488
Baek Ah Jin,
you're the first recipient.

432
00:30:45.614 --> 00:30:46.657
Isn't it a huge honor?

433
00:30:51.870 --> 00:30:53.497
- Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you.

434
00:30:55.999 --> 00:30:57.876
Did you ask your grandfather?

435
00:30:57.960 --> 00:31:00.963
What did you agree to do in return?

436
00:31:01.046 --> 00:31:02.047
Be a good grandson.

437
00:31:02.839 --> 00:31:05.258
He regularly goes to Japan
for treatment.

438
00:31:05.676 --> 00:31:07.260
He asked me to tag along this time.

439
00:31:07.552 --> 00:31:10.889
I decided to be
the best grandson I can be.

440
00:31:12.391 --> 00:31:13.392
Jun Seo.

441
00:31:14.393 --> 00:31:16.186
Don't you think this is still...

442
00:31:16.269 --> 00:31:19.606
I know what you're thinking,
but your enrollment comes first.

443
00:31:19.982 --> 00:31:22.985
Let's think about the rest
when you achieve your dream.

444
00:31:23.276 --> 00:31:24.987
Wait until after that. Okay?

445
00:31:29.825 --> 00:31:31.827
Let's eat. This looks amazing.

446
00:32:05.610 --> 00:32:06.611
Peekaboo.

447
00:32:07.112 --> 00:32:08.196
Dad's here.

448
00:32:09.364 --> 00:32:10.991
Get lost before I call the cops.

449
00:32:14.327 --> 00:32:16.913
It's not a crime for a dad
to visit his daughter.

450
00:32:18.832 --> 00:32:21.334
You want to study law
when you lack common knowledge?

451
00:32:21.418 --> 00:32:22.586
Give up.

452
00:32:25.255 --> 00:32:26.256
I need money.

453
00:32:28.633 --> 00:32:30.010
I don't have any.

454
00:32:30.093 --> 00:32:32.054
Where's the money you made
working day and night?

455
00:32:33.221 --> 00:32:34.639
You must have enough for tuition.

456
00:32:35.057 --> 00:32:36.308
It's not at home.

457
00:32:38.268 --> 00:32:39.519
Is it in there?

458
00:32:41.021 --> 00:32:42.481
It must be in here.

459
00:32:42.856 --> 00:32:43.857
Hand it over.

460
00:32:43.940 --> 00:32:44.941
Get away.

461
00:32:47.319 --> 00:32:48.445
This bitch.

462
00:32:54.951 --> 00:32:57.537
Are you crazy?
Have you lost your mind?

463
00:33:00.123 --> 00:33:01.249
You're insane.

464
00:33:02.209 --> 00:33:03.251
Damn it.

465
00:33:06.254 --> 00:33:09.091
It's not safe to carry cash around.

466
00:33:11.009 --> 00:33:12.427
Why, you...

467
00:33:19.518 --> 00:33:20.519
You're crazy.

468
00:33:21.061 --> 00:33:22.813
You're out of your mind.

469
00:33:22.896 --> 00:33:25.232
You're insane. Totally mad.

470
00:33:52.551 --> 00:33:53.718
Ah Jin.

471
00:33:56.304 --> 00:33:57.305
Ah Jin?

472
00:34:03.645 --> 00:34:04.646
Ah Jin.

473
00:34:12.779 --> 00:34:13.780
What is it?

474
00:34:14.489 --> 00:34:15.490
Is something wrong?

475
00:34:16.616 --> 00:34:18.451
I'm sick.

476
00:34:19.911 --> 00:34:21.621
I think I caught a cold.

477
00:34:23.039 --> 00:34:25.292
Tell your mom, then.

478
00:34:26.251 --> 00:34:27.669
I told her.

479
00:34:28.587 --> 00:34:29.838
But she told me to sleep.

480
00:34:31.131 --> 00:34:32.549
Go and lie in bed.

481
00:34:32.883 --> 00:34:34.718
I'll find you some medicine.

482
00:34:50.400 --> 00:34:51.651
I couldn't find the medicine.

483
00:34:52.694 --> 00:34:55.238
But I'll stay with you
until you fall asleep.

484
00:34:57.282 --> 00:34:58.700
Thank you, Ah Jin.

485
00:34:59.868 --> 00:35:01.661
- Jun Seo.
- Yeah?

486
00:35:02.162 --> 00:35:05.332
You don't look like your mom at all.

487
00:35:05.415 --> 00:35:06.416
You're wrong.

488
00:35:07.334 --> 00:35:08.793
Hang on.

489
00:35:19.971 --> 00:35:22.224
Take a look. Don't we look alike?

490
00:35:23.016 --> 00:35:24.476
Who's this man here?

491
00:35:24.935 --> 00:35:26.978
That's Mr. Kang the chauffeur.

492
00:35:27.229 --> 00:35:31.024
He used to drive my dad around.

493
00:35:31.107 --> 00:35:34.819
He moved to another country
after Dad died.

494
00:35:35.612 --> 00:35:38.949
I cried so much because he left
without saying goodbye.

495
00:35:47.499 --> 00:35:48.500
Ah Jin.

496
00:35:48.875 --> 00:35:51.711
I have to take Jun Seo
to see a doctor.

497
00:35:51.795 --> 00:35:54.339
Will you take this to his mom
when she wakes up?

498
00:35:54.798 --> 00:35:56.007
- Okay.
- Thank you.

499
00:35:56.758 --> 00:35:57.759
Let's go.

500
00:36:14.651 --> 00:36:16.820
Jun Seo just left to see a doctor.

501
00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:21.783
I'm saying
it's just you and me at home.

502
00:36:23.285 --> 00:36:24.452
What do you want?

503
00:36:25.412 --> 00:36:26.955
I didn't say you could come in.

504
00:36:28.748 --> 00:36:33.003
Last night, Jun Seo showed me
a photo of his dad.

505
00:36:35.672 --> 00:36:37.716
He must've missed him
because he didn't feel well.

506
00:36:39.759 --> 00:36:41.303
But Ms. Hwang.

507
00:36:42.095 --> 00:36:43.680
Jun Seo's real dad.

508
00:36:44.472 --> 00:36:46.808
Why did he move abroad
without saying goodbye?

509
00:36:55.567 --> 00:36:58.361
What did you just say?

510
00:36:59.237 --> 00:37:00.947
Jun Seo's real dad did what?

511
00:37:02.073 --> 00:37:03.074
Said who?

512
00:37:05.160 --> 00:37:06.286
Did Jun Seo say so?

513
00:37:08.455 --> 00:37:12.125
It's funny to see you
get serious so suddenly.

514
00:37:13.043 --> 00:37:14.753
I was just joking.

515
00:37:15.879 --> 00:37:18.089
Jun Seo's real dad
didn't move abroad.

516
00:37:18.840 --> 00:37:20.967
Mr. Kang the chauffeur did.

517
00:37:23.094 --> 00:37:24.095
Ms. Hwang.

518
00:37:25.263 --> 00:37:27.390
I just figured out your secret.

519
00:37:28.725 --> 00:37:30.268
Jun Seo doesn't know yet.

520
00:37:30.977 --> 00:37:34.481
But what would happen
if he were to find out?

521
00:37:35.607 --> 00:37:37.025
Forget about that.

522
00:37:37.108 --> 00:37:39.402
What if his grandfather were to know?

523
00:37:44.991 --> 00:37:46.368
Are you blackmailing me?

524
00:37:48.244 --> 00:37:50.663
How dare a kid do that to an adult?

525
00:37:53.917 --> 00:37:55.126
That's why

526
00:37:56.544 --> 00:38:00.840
you should never dream
of sending me to an orphanage.

527
00:38:03.635 --> 00:38:04.636
By the way.

528
00:38:05.553 --> 00:38:06.930
I need some clothes.

529
00:38:07.514 --> 00:38:10.809
This is all I brought
when I moved in.

530
00:38:12.060 --> 00:38:13.144
Thanks in advance.

531
00:38:20.902 --> 00:38:22.112
How does this look?

532
00:38:23.780 --> 00:38:25.782
- Do I look nice?
- Yeah.

533
00:38:26.408 --> 00:38:27.409
It's pretty.

534
00:38:31.454 --> 00:38:32.455
What about this?

535
00:38:33.873 --> 00:38:34.874
It's pretty.

536
00:38:38.044 --> 00:38:39.087
What's wrong?

537
00:38:39.170 --> 00:38:40.171
Are you sulking?

538
00:38:41.339 --> 00:38:44.050
I want to go outside, too.

539
00:38:45.468 --> 00:38:47.929
Mom won't let me leave home.

540
00:38:48.805 --> 00:38:49.806
Jun Seo.

541
00:38:51.933 --> 00:38:55.103
Do you think your mom loves you?

542
00:38:56.229 --> 00:38:58.064
She doesn't let you go outside

543
00:38:59.524 --> 00:39:02.902
and she won't even let you
say hi to the neighbors.

544
00:39:04.279 --> 00:39:05.572
Why do you think that is?

545
00:39:07.782 --> 00:39:08.992
Your mom.

546
00:39:10.869 --> 00:39:12.454
She's ashamed of you.

547
00:39:13.830 --> 00:39:16.040
Because she doesn't love you.

548
00:39:16.499 --> 00:39:19.794
Her one and only son told her
he didn't feel well

549
00:39:20.170 --> 00:39:22.589
but she didn't care at all.

550
00:39:23.423 --> 00:39:25.717
I'm the one who looks after you.

551
00:39:28.261 --> 00:39:29.429
Ah Jin.

552
00:39:30.472 --> 00:39:31.973
Does my mom

553
00:39:33.391 --> 00:39:34.934
not love me?

554
00:39:35.935 --> 00:39:36.936
No.

555
00:39:38.396 --> 00:39:40.607
She doesn't love you.

556
00:39:41.399 --> 00:39:43.318
So, she doesn't even get angry.

557
00:39:44.360 --> 00:39:47.780
Your mom isn't on your side.

558
00:39:48.990 --> 00:39:52.118
I bet she's thinking of ways
to get rid of us.

559
00:39:57.749 --> 00:40:00.168
Baek Ah Jin, your daughter,
is absolutely psycho.

560
00:40:00.835 --> 00:40:02.837
The kid manipulates me to no end.

561
00:40:03.463 --> 00:40:06.549
Why cause trouble by aggravating her?

562
00:40:06.633 --> 00:40:08.468
I told you to bear with it.

563
00:40:09.344 --> 00:40:10.345
Forget it.

564
00:40:11.346 --> 00:40:13.806
I can't live with her anymore.

565
00:40:13.890 --> 00:40:16.017
Take her with you
or leave her at an orphanage.

566
00:40:16.100 --> 00:40:18.728
We'll never be legally married
until then.

567
00:40:18.811 --> 00:40:20.605
I'm on my way right now.

568
00:40:20.688 --> 00:40:23.233
I'll text you
to bring the kid outside.

569
00:40:23.316 --> 00:40:24.609
Make sure she doesn't notice.

570
00:40:40.250 --> 00:40:41.251
What now?

571
00:40:41.751 --> 00:40:42.919
Are you spying on me again?

572
00:40:43.419 --> 00:40:45.046
I told you last time

573
00:40:45.880 --> 00:40:48.758
that I'd tell Jun Seo everything
if you split us up.

574
00:40:50.343 --> 00:40:51.844
You're blackmailing me again.

575
00:40:51.928 --> 00:40:54.222
This is the last day
I put up with this.

576
00:40:54.305 --> 00:40:58.685
He doesn't know how things are
because you keep him indoors

577
00:40:59.060 --> 00:41:02.355
but I bet he has a gut feeling.

578
00:41:02.438 --> 00:41:04.816
That his mom is a piece of trash.

579
00:41:08.111 --> 00:41:10.113
- Stay still!
- Jun Seo!

580
00:41:10.196 --> 00:41:11.406
Jun Seo!

581
00:42:03.458 --> 00:42:04.500
Die.

582
00:42:05.668 --> 00:42:06.878
Die.

583
00:42:07.795 --> 00:42:08.921
Die.

584
00:42:09.213 --> 00:42:10.256
Just die!

585
00:42:12.342 --> 00:42:13.926
Die already.

586
00:42:14.010 --> 00:42:15.428
Die!

587
00:42:30.276 --> 00:42:31.277
Jun Seo...

588
00:42:33.154 --> 00:42:34.155
Jun Seo.

589
00:42:34.947 --> 00:42:36.658
Do you like your mom?

590
00:42:37.283 --> 00:42:40.411
Do you think your mom loves you?

591
00:42:58.721 --> 00:43:01.182
Call 911 and say
a kid fell from the second floor.

592
00:43:01.808 --> 00:43:02.975
Do it right now!

593
00:43:34.924 --> 00:43:36.092
What are you doing?

594
00:43:36.843 --> 00:43:37.844
Ms. Hwang.

595
00:43:38.469 --> 00:43:39.470
Guess what?

596
00:43:40.513 --> 00:43:43.558
People don't always die
from falling from high places.

597
00:43:44.350 --> 00:43:46.018
My mom didn't.

598
00:43:47.729 --> 00:43:49.731
I went to check if she was dead.

599
00:43:50.314 --> 00:43:53.151
But she begged me to help her
as she lay on the ground.

600
00:43:55.570 --> 00:43:56.571
No.

601
00:43:57.655 --> 00:43:58.656
You'll die.

602
00:44:01.159 --> 00:44:02.952
- Get down from there.
- No.

603
00:44:05.496 --> 00:44:07.415
I won't die easily, either.

604
00:44:09.041 --> 00:44:12.044
I'm pretty lucky

605
00:44:13.337 --> 00:44:15.256
and I'm a lot like my mom.

606
00:44:38.988 --> 00:44:41.574
I told you she shouldn't have a scar.

607
00:44:41.657 --> 00:44:43.743
How was I to know she'd jump?

608
00:44:43.826 --> 00:44:45.495
I told you so many times.

609
00:44:45.578 --> 00:44:48.623
She's no ordinary witch.
You can't upset her.

610
00:44:48.998 --> 00:44:51.501
We can't film a girl
with a bust-up head and broken leg.

611
00:44:52.168 --> 00:44:54.045
How are we to wait until she heals?

612
00:44:54.128 --> 00:44:56.339
Forget the money.
Send her away already!

613
00:44:56.422 --> 00:44:58.299
No way! She's worth a fortune.

614
00:44:59.842 --> 00:45:03.596
You don't have to listen
to the bad things grown-ups say.

615
00:45:06.265 --> 00:45:07.683
Why are you crying?

616
00:45:09.227 --> 00:45:11.854
I read your diary.

617
00:45:13.314 --> 00:45:14.315
DIARY
BAEK AH JIN

618
00:45:14.398 --> 00:45:16.192
I also know what X means.

619
00:45:18.778 --> 00:45:21.239
X gets angry
only when Jun Seo isn't around.

620
00:45:21.322 --> 00:45:23.324
I'm so sad when Jun Seo isn't around.

621
00:45:23.407 --> 00:45:24.867
X is such a bad grown-up.

622
00:45:24.951 --> 00:45:26.911
I hope Jun Seo takes my side.

623
00:45:26.994 --> 00:45:28.704
I don't want to go to an orphanage.

624
00:45:28.788 --> 00:45:30.665
I can't make X angry.

625
00:45:33.501 --> 00:45:36.963
Then you must know
X is a bad grown-up.

626
00:45:38.631 --> 00:45:39.632
I know.

627
00:45:40.132 --> 00:45:41.133
I'm sorry.

628
00:45:41.843 --> 00:45:44.345
You looked after me all night.

629
00:45:45.054 --> 00:45:46.597
Yet I didn't know about it.

630
00:45:46.681 --> 00:45:48.808
Do you still like X?

631
00:45:48.891 --> 00:45:51.394
No, I don't like her.

632
00:45:53.229 --> 00:45:54.605
I only like you, Ah Jin.

633
00:45:55.189 --> 00:45:57.608
You're the only nice person at home.

634
00:46:01.654 --> 00:46:02.655
"Home"?

635
00:46:03.739 --> 00:46:06.158
I might not be able to go back there.

636
00:46:07.326 --> 00:46:09.787
I might get kicked out.

637
00:46:10.329 --> 00:46:11.330
Says who?

638
00:46:12.039 --> 00:46:13.457
You won't get kicked out.

639
00:46:14.834 --> 00:46:17.420
I'll protect you so she can't do

640
00:46:18.546 --> 00:46:19.797
anything bad to you.

641
00:46:20.840 --> 00:46:22.133
Does that mean

642
00:46:22.466 --> 00:46:24.343
you'll always be on my side?

643
00:46:24.635 --> 00:46:27.263
Yes, I'm always on your side.

644
00:46:28.264 --> 00:46:31.392
So, Ah Jin,
don't ever let go of my hand.

645
00:46:32.143 --> 00:46:33.144
Okay?

646
00:46:55.207 --> 00:46:57.460
Ah Jin, are you all right?

647
00:46:58.085 --> 00:46:59.211
You're awake.

648
00:46:59.712 --> 00:47:00.713
Do you recognize me?

649
00:47:02.089 --> 00:47:03.507
How can't I

650
00:47:04.300 --> 00:47:06.385
when you're holding my hand so tight?

651
00:47:12.016 --> 00:47:14.018
Don't look at me like that.

652
00:47:14.101 --> 00:47:15.937
I'm not dead, am I?

653
00:47:16.020 --> 00:47:18.439
You were unconscious
for three days straight.

654
00:47:19.774 --> 00:47:20.775
What?

655
00:47:28.282 --> 00:47:29.367
What's the date today?

656
00:47:33.120 --> 00:47:36.082
The enrollment deadline
was two days ago.

657
00:47:38.292 --> 00:47:42.213
You didn't enroll in time,
so your admission was canceled.

658
00:47:42.296 --> 00:47:44.423
We texted you many times already.

659
00:47:45.967 --> 00:47:49.220
We already accepted
a student on the waiting list

660
00:47:49.303 --> 00:47:51.305
so I'm sorry about your situation.

661
00:47:51.389 --> 00:47:53.140
But there's nothing
we can do to help--

662
00:48:03.317 --> 00:48:06.529
Ah Jin, we graduate tomorrow.
Will you be at the ceremony?

663
00:48:07.571 --> 00:48:09.782
Yes, of course.

664
00:48:37.768 --> 00:48:38.769
Thank you.

665
00:49:05.212 --> 00:49:07.965
CONGRATULATIONS
ON YOUR GRADUATION

666
00:49:12.303 --> 00:49:14.472
Ah Jin, why are you still here?

667
00:49:16.265 --> 00:49:17.558
Are you all right?

668
00:49:17.641 --> 00:49:19.393
I was worried when I heard
you were hospitalized.

669
00:49:19.769 --> 00:49:20.770
What happened to your face?

670
00:49:21.645 --> 00:49:23.439
I'm fine. I just fell.

671
00:49:23.856 --> 00:49:25.566
You should've been more careful.

672
00:49:25.649 --> 00:49:27.485
Congratulations on graduating.

673
00:49:27.568 --> 00:49:28.569
I'll take a photo for you.

674
00:49:31.489 --> 00:49:32.782
Are you ready?

675
00:49:32.865 --> 00:49:34.408
One, two, three.

676
00:49:36.368 --> 00:49:37.369
Smile a bit, will you?

677
00:49:37.912 --> 00:49:39.580
One, two...

678
00:49:48.589 --> 00:49:49.632
Jun Seo.

679
00:49:50.716 --> 00:49:52.051
I'm sorry I got here so late.

680
00:49:53.302 --> 00:49:55.221
Congratulations on graduating.

681
00:49:55.513 --> 00:49:56.806
Let's take some photos. Let's go.

682
00:50:00.768 --> 00:50:03.938
Did you hear from your grandpa?

683
00:50:04.021 --> 00:50:05.606
Does he know you're graduating?

684
00:50:05.981 --> 00:50:06.982
Yes.

685
00:50:07.066 --> 00:50:09.235
How? Did you tell him?

686
00:50:10.319 --> 00:50:11.403
Yes.

687
00:50:11.779 --> 00:50:13.364
Did he say anything?

688
00:50:14.281 --> 00:50:17.451
About a graduation present
or something.

689
00:50:18.035 --> 00:50:19.036
Like what?

690
00:50:19.495 --> 00:50:22.915
I mean you're an adult now

691
00:50:22.998 --> 00:50:25.626
so he might have prepared
something special--

692
00:50:25.709 --> 00:50:27.253
Take this, Mom.

693
00:50:27.336 --> 00:50:29.213
I'll eat with my friends.

694
00:50:29.296 --> 00:50:30.840
Wait, Jun Seo. My gosh.

695
00:50:39.223 --> 00:50:40.975
- Get in here.
- One, two, three.

696
00:50:41.433 --> 00:50:42.434
Look here, Mom.

697
00:51:21.974 --> 00:51:24.393
Thief! Catch that thief!

698
00:51:25.394 --> 00:51:26.687
Oh, no!

699
00:51:30.191 --> 00:51:31.901
He's a pickpocket!

700
00:51:40.868 --> 00:51:41.869
You asshole!

701
00:52:12.650 --> 00:52:15.945
If I hadn't cross paths
with that man then

702
00:52:17.446 --> 00:52:20.157
his life would've been
completely different.

703
00:52:22.785 --> 00:52:23.827
It's such a shame.

704
00:52:29.124 --> 00:52:31.710
The newbie's just 20 years old?

705
00:52:31.794 --> 00:52:33.837
He was sent here
from a youth detention center.

706
00:52:33.921 --> 00:52:36.632
His skin is so smooth and firm.

707
00:52:37.049 --> 00:52:38.133
I did, too, once.

708
00:52:39.134 --> 00:52:40.135
Jeez.

709
00:52:41.220 --> 00:52:42.221
What's he in for?

710
00:52:43.305 --> 00:52:45.099
Murder, but not just any kind.

711
00:52:45.808 --> 00:52:47.393
Patricide. My gosh.

712
00:52:47.851 --> 00:52:50.729
That young guy killed his dad?

713
00:52:50.813 --> 00:52:52.648
Kids these days are fearless.

714
00:52:52.731 --> 00:52:55.276
I talked to him a bit,
and he's pretty docile.

715
00:52:55.734 --> 00:52:59.446
He got bullied so much
at the youth detention center.

716
00:52:59.989 --> 00:53:01.282
He could've stayed there

717
00:53:01.699 --> 00:53:03.367
but he chose to be transferred here.

718
00:53:10.582 --> 00:53:15.170
DEAR X

719
00:55:35.269 --> 00:55:37.271
Subtitles by Jennifer Jean Lim

